- `/Users/johyunduk/Projects/ddong-avoid-game/src/scenes/CharacterSelectScene.ts` (line 42)
- `/Users/johyunduk/Projects/ddong-avoid-game/src/utils/wallpaper.ts` (lines 1-148)
- `/Users/johyunduk/Projects/ddong-avoid-game/supabase/functions/gacha-pull/index.ts` (lines 12-17)

